  description: Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from
    your hand) while the total ATK of all monsters your opponent controls is more
    than that of all monsters you control. You can target any number of Beast, Beast-Warrior,
    and/or Winged Beast monsters you control; return them to the hand, then, return
    face-up monsters your opponent controls to the hand, equal to the number of cards
    you returned to the hand, also for the rest of this turn, "Alpha, the Master
    of Beasts" you control cannot attack directly. You can only use this effect of
    "Alpha, the Master of Beasts" once per turn.
